  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:36px\"><strong>J</strong><strong>u</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>st</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:36px\"> <strong>E</strong><strong>n</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:36px\"><strong>ou</strong></span><span style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:36px\"><strong>gh</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\"> <strong>Ef</strong></span><span style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:36px\"><strong>fe</strong></span><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:36px\"><strong>ct</strong> </span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#008080\"><strong>De</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#f90\"><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"color:#008080\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">sc</span><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">ri</span><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:36px\">pt</span><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">io</span><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:36px\">ns</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於&nbsp;📖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED) 是一個 JEI/REI/EMI 插件，提供關於狀態效果的實用資訊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個模組新增了一個效果配方類別，可以透過點擊 JEI 物品畫面中新增的狀態效果圖示，或是在物品欄畫面中點擊活躍效果框來進入。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在這裡，你可以查看關於該狀態效果的資訊，例如能提供該效果的物品、其描述、來自哪個模組，以及它的效果顏色。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P8qv5ZN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UfGgoGG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🧪 自訂化🧪</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">該模組會自動將所有已註冊的狀態效果新增到其頁面中，但模組效果預設不會有描述。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;任何人都可以輕鬆為其效果添加描述，只需將字串 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">\"effect.[mod_id].[effect_name].description\"</span> 加入到您資源包中的語言檔案即可。理想情況下，這應該由模組作者自行完成。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">作為模組作者，您也可以使用 <em>JeedAPI</em> 類別來為您的畫面註冊擴展，或使用原版類別告訴 Jeed 效果渲染的位置，使其可以點擊。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由於該模組只能自動檢測食物物品為效果提供者，模組開發者也可以輕鬆地為其自訂效果或提供效果的物品添加支援，方法是在其模組中加入一些配方。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">要這麼做，只需使用以下兩種新增的配方類別之一：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>\"jeed:effect_provider\"</em>，允許指定一個可以提供效果的物品，格式如下：</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre>{<br>  \"type\": \"jeed:effect_provider\",<br>  \"effect\":  \"minecraft:haste\",<br>  \"providers\": [<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:beacon\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</pre>\n<p>此 JSON 也可以包含 \"fluid_providers\" 和 \"effect_providers\" 鍵，兩者都可以分別容納流體或效果的標籤或列表。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>\"jeed:potion_provider\"</em>，允許指定一個可以包含任何已註冊藥水的物品，例如藥水箭：</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre>{<br>  \"type\": \"jeed:potion_provider\",<br>  \"providers\": [<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:splash_potion\"<br>    },<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:tipped_arrow\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您想幫助我為許多模組效果提供內建描述支援，請務必在我的 Discord 上聯繫我！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組開發佔用了我很多時間，所以如果您喜歡我所做的事，並且願意支持我，您可以在這裡這麼做。如果您支持我，您將會獲得一個專屬於您的自訂 <strong>地球儀</strong> 和/或 <strong>雕像</strong>！如果您使用代碼 \"supplementaries\" 從 Akliz 購買伺服器，也同樣適用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？看看 Akliz，他們擁有專為模組化 Minecraft 設計的高端伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們確實有一個溫馨的社群，提供出色的支援，而且伺服器運行得非常好。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代碼 \"supplementaries\" 可獲得 <strong>20% 折扣</strong>，同時也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
